            "text": "Not all work arrangements follow the W-2 model. If you freelance, consult, drive for a rideshare platform, or perform work as an independent contractor, you are classified as a 1099 worker. The name comes from the IRS Form 1099-NEC (Nonemployee Compensation), which clients issue to report payments made to you."
