            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Pre-Tax Deductions: These are subtracted from your gross pay before taxes are calculated, which reduces your taxable income. Common pre-tax deductions include health insurance premiums, dental and vision insurance, Health Savings Account (HSA) contributions, Flexible Spending Account (FSA) contributions, and 401(k) or 403(b) retirement plan contributions."
